# This is a PRIVATE, personal instance of career-ops for Anu's job search —
# unlike the public santifer/career-ops template, this repo's whole purpose
# is to persist her real data (cv.md, config/profile.yml, portals.yml,
# data/*, reports/*) so the scheduled cloud routine can read and update it
# across runs. Only truly ephemeral/regenerable artifacts are excluded here.

node_modules/
.env
.DS_Store
*.mov
*.mp4
*.bak*
*.tmp*
*.db-wal
*.db-shm
.tmp-script-test-*/
.playwright-mcp/
test-results/
playwright-report/
.idea/
.vscode/
.claude/settings.local.json
.claude/memory/
.opencode/settings.local.json
.opencode/memory/
career-dashboard
career-dashboard.exe
.career-ops-web/
plan/
reports/*-RESERVED.md
